    "name": "Volubilis International Festival of Traditional World Music",
    "id": "volubilis-world-music-festival",
    "description": "International festival of traditional world music staged in the Roman archaeological site of Volubilis, a UNESCO World Heritage site, and in the squares of Meknes. It hosts musical cultures from around the world in a dialogue of civilizations.",
